.TH start-cli-package-force-stop 1  "force-stop "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-package\-force\-stop \- Force stop a stalled service; may cause data loss
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli package force\-stop\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIID\fR> <\fIFORCE_STOP_AT\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Force stop a stalled service; may cause data loss
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIID\fR>
Package identifier
.TP
<\fIFORCE_STOP_AT\fR>
Server\-issued forceStopAt from service status, in RFC3339 format; stale deadlines are rejected
